# Read by Cloudflare, never served: wrangler leaves _headers out of the upload.

# The Content Security Policy. A header, not a <meta> in index.html: Chromium
# holds back its preload scanner's fetches until a <meta> policy is parsed, and
# the seventeen scripts then came down one after another, ~3s instead of ~1s
# (cold loads of the live site, 30/09/2026). A header also covers the document from its first byte and can say
# frame-ancestors, which a <meta> cannot.
#
# default-src 'none' denies everything, then:
#
# script-src and style-src 'self', no unsafe-inline: every script comes from
# js/, GoatCounter's vendored copy included, and styles set from JS go through
# the CSSOM, which no CSP governs. One script comes from elsewhere, named down
# to its path: Cloudflare Web Analytics' beacon.
#
# connect-src - this site's /api, the GW2 API, three read-only Google Sheets,
# Cloudflare Web Analytics' collector and GoatCounter, which falls back from
# sendBeacon to an image - hence that host in img-src too. The three sheets are
# one host and one entry: the community guild list when a shield is clicked,
# this project's own kills history when a tier's maps are opened, and the one
# cell saying whether the new teams are out.
#
# img-src - everything local except guild emblems, which come from ArenaNet's
# asset host; there are hundreds of thousands of them and they change.
#
# base-uri and form-action 'none' - no <base> hijacking, no forms.
# frame-ancestors 'none' - no other site can frame this one.
#
# check-structure.py reads the policy from this line; check-site.py compares
# it with what wvwrelink.com serves.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js; style-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.guildwars2.com https://docs.google.com https://cloudflareinsights.com https://melquiisedeq.goatcounter.com; img-src 'self' data: https://render.guildwars2.com https://melquiisedeq.goatcounter.com; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), browsing-topics=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
